Package: cnma
Type: Package
Title: Comprehensive Network Meta-Analysis with PRISMA-NMA Compliance
Version: 1.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("CNMA Development Team", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "dev@example.com")
    )
Description: A comprehensive, journal-ready toolkit for conducting network meta-analysis
    following PRISMA-NMA guidelines and best practices from Statistics in Medicine,
    Research Synthesis Methods, and BMJ. Features include frequentist network meta-analysis,
    treatment ranking (P-scores/SUCRA), inconsistency assessment (global, local, and
    design-based), prediction intervals, league tables, publication bias assessment,
    sensitivity analyses, transitivity evaluation, and publication-quality visualizations.
    Implements methods from Rücker & Schwarzer (2015), Dias et al. (2010), Krahn et al. (2013),
    and Hutton et al. (2015). Designed for researchers conducting systematic reviews and
    meta-analyses in healthcare and other fields.
